{"id":"vd-a2-the-sleeping-lion","level":"a2","n":28,"title":{"en":"How Do I Get There?","vi":"Đi đến đó bằng cách nào?"},"summary":"Trước tiệm cắt tóc, Kenji hỏi đường đến tượng Sư tử ngủ — và nhận được những lời chỉ dẫn rất tự tin.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-sleeping-lion","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Sleeping Lion","vi":"Chú sư tử ngủ"}},"scene":{"background":"street","props":[]},"cast":{"kenji":{"name":{"en":"Kenji","vi":"Kenji"},"look":"man","x":560,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#EAC7A0","skinShade":"#D6AE85","outfit":"jacket","top":"#3E6FB0","topShade":"#305A93"}},"barber":{"name":{"en":"Barber","vi":"Bác thợ cắt tóc"},"look":"grandpa","x":1150,"style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#F2F2F2","topShade":"#DADADA"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Excuse me. Could you help me, please?","vi":"Xin lỗi. Bác giúp cháu được không ạ?","ipa":["ɪkˈskjuz","mi","kʊd","ju","hɛlp","mi","pliz"],"start":0.554,"end":3.644,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.036],[2,2.236],[3,2.418],[4,2.549],[5,2.783],[6,3.147]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Of course. Are you lost?","vi":"Tất nhiên rồi. Cậu bị lạc à?","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","ɑɹ","ju","lɔst"],"start":4.434,"end":6.724,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,4.434],[1,4.566],[2,5.836],[3,6.054],[4,6.203]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"A little. I'm looking for the Sleeping Lion.","vi":"Hơi hơi ạ. Cháu đang tìm tượng Sư tử ngủ.","ipa":["ə","ˈlɪtəl","aɪm","ˈlʊkɪŋ","fɔɹ","ðə","ˈslipɪŋ","ˈlaɪən"],"start":7.514,"end":10.644,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,7.514],[1,7.55],[2,8.92],[3,9.154],[4,9.479],[5,9.61],[6,9.714],[7,10.196]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Ah, the stone lion! It's not far from here.","vi":"À, con sư tử đá! Không xa đây đâu.","ipa":["ɑ","ðə","stoʊn","ˈlaɪən","ɪts","nɑt","fɑɹ","fɹʌm","hiɹ"],"start":11.434,"end":15.184,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,11.434],[1,11.817],[2,12.021],[3,12.415],[4,13.604],[5,13.876],[6,14.189],[7,14.501],[8,14.705]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Great! How do I get there?","vi":"Tuyệt quá! Cháu đi đến đó bằng cách nào ạ?","ipa":["ɡɹeɪt","haʊ","du","aɪ","ɡɛt","ðɛɹ"],"start":15.974,"end":18.264,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,15.974],[1,17.356],[2,17.552],[3,17.682],[4,17.786],[5,17.995]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Go straight on until you get to the roundabout.","vi":"Cứ đi thẳng cho đến khi tới vòng xuyến.","ipa":["ɡoʊ","stɹeɪt","ɑn","ənˈtɪl","ju","ɡɛt","tu","ðə","ˈɹaʊndəˌbaʊt"],"start":19.054,"end":21.544,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,19.054],[1,19.223],[2,19.617],[3,19.889],[4,20.242],[5,20.419],[6,20.65],[7,20.758],[8,20.894]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Straight on to the roundabout. OK.","vi":"Đi thẳng đến vòng xuyến. Vâng.","ipa":["stɹeɪt","ɑn","tu","ðə","ˈɹaʊndəˌbaʊt","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":22.334,"end":25.304,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,22.334],[1,22.744],[2,22.965],[3,23.056],[4,23.174],[5,24.79]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Then turn left and walk past the bank.","vi":"Rồi rẽ trái và đi qua ngân hàng.","ipa":["ðɛn","tɝn","lɛft","ənd","wɔk","pæst","ðə","bæŋk"],"start":26.094,"end":28.334,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,26.094],[1,26.27],[2,26.61],[3,26.99],[4,27.167],[5,27.466],[6,27.901],[7,27.996]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Sorry, did you say left or right?","vi":"Xin lỗi, bác nói trái hay phải ạ?","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","dɪd","ju","seɪ","lɛft","ɔɹ","ɹaɪt"],"start":29.124,"end":31.324,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,29.124],[1,29.823],[2,29.993],[3,30.11],[4,30.383],[5,30.8],[6,30.956]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Left. The lion is opposite the bookshop. You can't miss it.","vi":"Trái. Con sư tử ở đối diện hiệu sách. Dễ thấy lắm.","ipa":["lɛft","ðə","ˈlaɪən","ɪz","ˈɑpəzət","ðə","ˈbʊkˌʃɑp","ju","kænt","mɪs","ɪt"],"start":32.114,"end":37.174,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,32.114],[1,33.272],[2,33.489],[3,33.842],[4,34.033],[5,34.617],[6,34.739],[7,36.155],[8,36.345],[9,36.671],[10,36.997]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"How far is it? Can I walk?","vi":"Có xa không ạ? Cháu đi bộ được không?","ipa":["haʊ","fɑɹ","ɪz","ɪt","kæn","aɪ","wɔk"],"start":37.964,"end":40.474,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,37.964],[1,38.15],[2,38.449],[3,38.605],[4,39.727],[5,39.896],[6,40.001]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"Yes, it's about ten minutes on foot.","vi":"Được, đi bộ chừng mười phút thôi.","ipa":["jɛs","ɪts","əˈbaʊt","tɛn","ˈmɪnəts","ɑn","fʊt"],"start":41.264,"end":44.004,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,41.264],[1,42.225],[2,42.428],[3,42.768],[4,43.067],[5,43.42],[6,43.638]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Thank you so much. You've been very helpful.","vi":"Cảm ơn bác nhiều lắm. Bác giúp cháu nhiều quá.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","soʊ","mʌtʃ","juv","bɪn","ˈvɛɹi","ˈhɛlpfəl"],"start":44.794,"end":48.124,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,44.794],[1,44.983],[2,45.126],[3,45.451],[4,46.873],[5,47.12],[6,47.302],[7,47.628]]},{"speaker":"barber","en":"You're welcome. Although… I haven't seen that lion for years.","vi":"Không có gì. Có điều… lâu lắm rồi bác không thấy con sư tử đó.","ipa":["jʊɹ","ˈwɛlkəm","ˌɔlˈðoʊ","aɪ","ˈhævənt","sin","ðæt","ˈlaɪən","fɔɹ","jɪɹz"],"start":48.914,"end":53.814,"expression":"thinking","react":{"kenji":"confused"},"timing":[[0,48.914],[1,49.086],[2,50.371],[3,51.705],[4,51.936],[5,52.276],[6,52.561],[7,52.765],[8,53.145],[9,53.281]]}],"words":[{"id":"lost","en":"lost","ipa":"lɔst","vi":"bị mất; lạc đường; đã thua","level":1},{"id":"straight","en":"straight","ipa":"stɹeɪt","vi":"thẳng; ngay thẳng; liên tiếp","level":0},{"id":"roundabout","en":"roundabout","ipa":"ˈɹaʊndəˌbaʊt","vi":"bùng binh; vòng vo","level":1},{"id":"opposite","en":"opposite","ipa":"ˈɑpəzət","vi":"đối diện; trái ngược; điều ngược lại","level":1},{"id":"far","en":"far","ipa":"fɑɹ","vi":"xa; xa xôi; nhiều","level":1},{"id":"helpful","en":"helpful","ipa":"ˈhɛlpfəl","vi":"hữu ích; giúp ích","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi và chỉ đường","pattern":"How do I get to …? · Go straight on · Turn left/right at … · It's opposite … · You can't miss it. · How far is it?","explain":"Hỏi đường: \"How do I get to…?\" hoặc \"I'm looking for…\". Chỉ đường dùng câu mệnh lệnh: \"Go straight on\", \"Turn left at the roundabout\", \"Walk past the bank\". Vị trí: \"opposite\" (đối diện), \"next to\" (cạnh). \"You can't miss it\" = dễ thấy lắm. Hỏi khoảng cách: \"How far is it?\".","keys":["how do i get","go straight on","turn left","opposite","you can't miss it","how far"],"lines":[4,5,7,9,10]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-sleeping-lion.mp3","v":"96cdaecb3c","duration":54.912,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}